@node Top
@top emacs-devtools-mcp

This manual describes @code{emacs-devtools-mcp}, a Model Context Protocol
server that runs inside Emacs and lets a coding agent introspect frames,
windows, buffers, faces, keymaps, hooks, advice, the message log, the
@samp{*Warnings*} buffer, and your @file{init.el}.  Version
0.1.0.

